Read and follow `AGENTS.md`. Use `docs/best-practices.md` for review-only
choices and `docs/rules/index.md` for diagnostic boundaries. Generated code
must not introduce sync-over-async, dropped cancellation, invalid DI lifetimes,
unbounded request queries, dynamic raw SQL, N+1 loops, or read-only tracking.
